  "summary_en": "Product page for ANSI/UL 4600 Edition 3 (March 2023), a voluntary safety standard for building and evaluating safety cases for autonomous vehicles operating without human supervision. The new edition adds autonomous trucking content, a more precise Safety Performance Indicator definition, and post-incident behavior requirements.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Covers safety principles, risk mitigation and lifecycle processes for building and evaluating safety cases for autonomous-mode vehicles.",
   "Assumes operation without human supervision; human driver responsibilities and handover are out of scope.",
   "Requires a Security Plan; foreseeable misuse and physical attacks are in scope.",
   "Edition 3 revises the framework for autonomous trucking and defines Safety Performance Indicators more precisely.",
   "Adds post-incident behavior requirements (Sections 10.6.6 and 10.6.7)."
